<title>UK: One Brent date clocked, the other deferred - trade.</title>
<headline>One Brent date clocked, the other deferred - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>One of two Brent dates to be nominated from the paper chain on Tuesday was clocked and in dispute between Shell U.K. and J.Aron at 1616 GMT, while the other was deferred, traders said.</p>
<p>One trader expected the clocking to end up with J.Aron.</p>
<p>The deferred cargo was put back to late September by Esso, he added.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
</text>
